												<div>
  <h4>Basic Digital Thermometer</h4>
  <p>The Basic digital thermometer is the perfect tool for accurately measuring temperatures in a range from -50 °C to 150 °C. Thanks to its robust stainless steel design, it ensures exceptional durability and reliable performance.</p>

  <h4>Main Features</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>125 mm stainless steel probe for high corrosion resistance.</li>
    <li>Probe diameter: Ø 3.5 mm, ideal for precise measurements.</li>
    <li>Extended measurement range: from -50 °C to 150 °C.</li>
    <li>Resolution of 0.1 °C for optimal precision.</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Recommended Use</h4>
  <p>This thermometer is ideal for use in professional kitchens, laboratories, or any environment requiring precise temperature control. Perfect for monitoring liquids, foods, or materials needing rigorous thermal monitoring.</p>

  <h4>Additional Benefits</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Easy to clean thanks to its stainless steel design.</li>
    <li>Compact and lightweight for easy handling.</li>
    <li>Versatile, suitable for a wide range of professional applications.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
 
											</div>

										</div>
									</collapsible-expandable>
								

							
					
						
					
						
					
				</div>
